Here is the root cause:
The bug occurs when the trace client fails to connect to ZooKeeper, causing it not to set the necessary watcher and, as a result, the tracing is never initialized properly. This situation can happen if there are intermittent connectivity issues or misconfigurations that prevent a successful connection during the initialization process.

